{
  "_note": "帳票ブロックの[内容]（§9.274）の突き合わせ用。サーバー(backend/repositories/report_block_repo.py の parse_content/dump_content)と画面(static/js/master-maint.js の fbParse/fbText)は同じ約束を別々に持っているので、同じ例で両方を確かめる。tests/test_rbcells.py と tests/test_rbcells.js が読む。**片方だけ直さないこと**——2通りあると、盤で組んだ形と紙が食い違う（§9.245）。",

  "_parse_note": "text を読んだ結果が cells。cells は label/path/kind/span/rows/showLabel/align/format の7つで比べる（blank は kind から決まるので比べない）。",
  "parse": [
    {
      "why": "今までの1行1件。**足したのは任意の後置きだけ**なので、既に登録してある塊はそのまま読める",
      "text": "ロット番号=basic.lotNo\n検査番号=basic.inspectionNo",
      "cells": [
        {"label": "ロット番号", "path": "basic.lotNo", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null},
        {"label": "検査番号", "path": "basic.inspectionNo", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "`=`が無い行はラベルも道も同じ／カンマ・読点でも区切れる",
      "text": "basic.lotNo、取引先=basic.customer",
      "cells": [
        {"label": "basic.lotNo", "path": "basic.lotNo", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null},
        {"label": "取引先", "path": "basic.customer", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "§9.245 横のマス数／§9.255 ② 横x縦。`x`が無ければ縦1（古い保存値がそのまま読める）",
      "text": "A=basic.lotNo|2\nB=basic.customer|3x2",
      "cells": [
        {"label": "A", "path": "basic.lotNo", "kind": "value", "span": 2, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null},
        {"label": "B", "path": "basic.customer", "kind": "value", "span": 3, "rows": 2, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "空きマスは落とさない（場所を取ることが役目。消すとマトリクスが1マスずつ詰まって崩れる）",
      "text": "|1\nA=basic.lotNo\n|2",
      "cells": [
        {"label": "", "path": "", "kind": "blank", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": false, "align": "", "format": null},
        {"label": "A", "path": "basic.lotNo", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null},
        {"label": "", "path": "", "kind": "blank", "span": 2, "rows": 1, "showLabel": false, "align": "", "format": null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "マス数は範囲へ丸める（1〜12）。壊れた数は1",
      "text": "A=basic.lotNo|99\nB=basic.customer|0\nC=basic.delivery|あ",
      "cells": [
        {"label": "A", "path": "basic.lotNo", "kind": "value", "span": 12, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null},
        {"label": "B", "path": "basic.customer", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null},
        {"label": "C", "path": "basic.delivery", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "§9.274 見出しのマス（文字だけ・値の道を持たない）と、ラベルを出さないマス。JSONは`[`で始まるかどうかだけで見分ける",
      "text": "[{\"kind\":\"blank\",\"span\":1,\"rows\":1},{\"kind\":\"head\",\"label\":\"MIN\",\"span\":1,\"rows\":1},{\"kind\":\"value\",\"label\":\"板厚\",\"path\":\"stat.thickness.min\",\"span\":1,\"rows\":1,\"showLabel\":false,\"align\":\"right\"}]",
      "cells": [
        {"label": "", "path": "", "kind": "blank", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": false, "align": "", "format": null},
        {"label": "MIN", "path": "", "kind": "head", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": false, "align": "", "format": null},
        {"label": "板厚", "path": "stat.thickness.min", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": false, "align": "right", "format": null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "§9.274 書式は`WL.cellFormat`と同じ綴り。既定だけの`text`は持たない（何も変えていない塊まで保存のたびに形が変わる）",
      "text": "[{\"kind\":\"value\",\"label\":\"厚み\",\"path\":\"stat.thickness.avg\",\"format\":{\"kind\":\"number\",\"decimals\":3,\"thousands\":true,\"suffix\":\"mm\"}},{\"kind\":\"value\",\"label\":\"日\",\"path\":\"workTime.startAt\",\"format\":{\"kind\":\"datetime\",\"pattern\":\"MM/dd\"}},{\"kind\":\"value\",\"label\":\"素\",\"path\":\"basic.lotNo\",\"format\":{\"kind\":\"text\"}}]",
      "cells": [
        {"label": "厚み", "path": "stat.thickness.avg", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": {"kind": "number", "decimals": 3, "thousands": true, "suffix": "mm"}},
        {"label": "日", "path": "workTime.startAt", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": {"kind": "datetime", "pattern": "MM/dd"}},
        {"label": "素", "path": "basic.lotNo", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "知らない種別・知らない寄せ・知らない書式は倒す（例外にすると塊が丸ごと開けなくなる・§9.215）",
      "text": "[{\"kind\":\"なぞ\",\"label\":\"A\",\"path\":\"basic.lotNo\",\"align\":\"ななめ\",\"format\":{\"kind\":\"色\"}}]",
      "cells": [
        {"label": "A", "path": "basic.lotNo", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "道を持たない「値」のマスは空きへ落とす（値の場所に`-`だけが並ぶのを防ぐ）",
      "text": "[{\"kind\":\"value\",\"label\":\"名前だけ\",\"path\":\"\"}]",
      "cells": [
        {"label": "", "path": "", "kind": "blank", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": false, "align": "", "format": null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "壊れたJSONは行の形として読み直す（黙って空にしない）",
      "text": "[これはJSONではない",
      "cells": [
        {"label": "[これはJSONではない", "path": "[これはJSONではない", "kind": "value", "span": 1, "rows": 1, "showLabel": true, "align": "", "format": null}
      ]
    },
    {
      "why": "空は空",
      "text": "",
      "cells": []
    }
  ],

  "_dump_note": "cells を書き出した結果が text。**新しい持ちものを1つも使っていなければ今までの行の形**（触っていない塊の保存値は1バイトも変わらない）。",
  "dump": [
